{"quest_id": 6185, "name": "光と闇の聖霊（記憶）", "description": "闇の聖霊の力を奪い、\n圧倒的な力を得た\n黄金のグレーターデーモンを討て！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "戦場の記憶～追憶の章～", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920094, "map_no": 5220, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "modifiers": [{"kind": "term", "influence": 14, "params": [150]}], "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 18, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1500, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097648, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 36, "global_id": 35, "spawn_sec": 20}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 133, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097680, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 38, "global_id": 37, "spawn_sec": 22}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 142, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098272, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 82, "global_id": 81, "spawn_sec": 33}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2700, "attack": 350, "base_hp": 2700, "base_attack": 350, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 70, "magic_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 3, "attack_interval": 89, "move_speed": 650.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098704, "race_id": 3, "special_effect_id": 42, "master_id": 111, "global_id": 110, "spawn_sec": 57}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 6500, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 6500, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 186, "move_speed": 300.0, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2111200, "race_id": 3, "change_to": 5, "change_condition": 2, "master_id": 30438, "global_id": 4057, "to_condition": 2, "to_global_id": 4054, "spawn_sec": 74}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 6300, "attack": 320, "base_hp": 6300, "base_attack": 320, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 12, "attack_interval": 42, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2111056, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 54, "master_id": 30435, "global_id": 4054, "from_condition": 2}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2000, "base_hp": 2000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 60, "attack_speed": 50, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100208, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 232, "global_id": 231, "spawn_sec": 77}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 36000, "attack": 4000, "base_hp": 36000, "base_attack": 4000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 245, "move_speed": 200.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.600000023841858, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103440, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 30437, "global_id": 4056, "spawn_sec": 95}], "popups": ["聖霊たちの力によって\n全ての味方ユニットは攻撃力が\nアップします。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "サヨ", "text": "さて、全部の戦いを振り返るのは時間が足りないから、\n印象深い戦いに絞って話すわ。\nその一つが闇の聖霊を巡る戦いね。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "聖霊だけど人に絶望した結果、\n人を滅ぼそうと魔物に力を与えていた闇の聖霊。\n彼女は凶悪なデーモンに圧倒的な力を与えた。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "闇の聖霊の力を利用しようとデーモンは彼女を捕まえ、\n捕らえられた彼女を助けるために王子たちは\n他の聖霊たちの加護を借りて戦いに挑んだのよね……。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "光彩の聖霊フェス", "text": "――そこの金色！\n闇の聖霊を離しなさい！", "face": "u303"}, {"name": "ゴールデンデーモン", "text": "この闇の聖霊はすでにワシのものなのだ。\n離すわけないだろう。", "face": "l4717979a74d5"}, {"name": "闇の聖霊", "text": "くそっ！　離せ！", "face": "u397"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、彼女を助けないと！\nでも一体、どうすれば……。", "face": "lb17e96a90f21"}, {"name": "ハッピー", "text": "心配いらないよ。\n人間の力だけで、どうしようもなかったらね。\nそんな時は、聖霊に力を借りたらいいのさ。", "face": "u194"}, {"name": "グラディス", "text": "大丈夫、私たちの祝福を貴方達に授けましょう。", "face": "u166"}, {"name": "アイナ", "text": "私の力を貸しますね！", "face": "u54"}, {"name": "サラ", "text": "……闇の聖霊さんを……助けてください。", "face": "u55"}, {"name": "シリル", "text": "絶対倒せるよ！", "face": "u56"}, {"name": "ニナ", "text": "王子の事、信じてます！", "face": "u57"}, {"name": "セリア", "text": "……私の力も……受けとってください。", "face": "u58"}, {"name": "フローリカ", "text": "わ、私だって！", "face": "u59"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "力が……溢れてくる……！\n聖霊のみなさん！\nありがとうございます！", "face": "lb17e96a90f21"}, {"name": "光彩の聖霊フェス", "text": "人間と聖霊が力を合わせた時、\nどんな困難ものり越えることができる。\nそれを証明してください！", "face": "u303"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ゴールデンデーモン", "text": "そ、そんなバカなぁぁぁぁ……！\nワ……ワシが、人間ごとき……に……！！\nく……悔し……い……。", "face": "l4717979a74d5"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "――デーモンを倒して、闇の聖霊を解放して……。\nそれからも沢山の出来事があった今、オニキスも\n常闇の聖霊として協力してくれるようになったのよね。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "あの時わたしはアークデーモンに化けていたの。\n聖霊の祝福を受けた王子たちには\nデーモンごとやられちゃったけど……。", "face": "u510"}, {"name": "サヨ", "text": "人間の力だけじゃなくて、\n女神アイギス様や聖霊の力も合わせて、\n王子たちは戦ってきたんだよね。", "face": "u510"}]}], "active": true}